tmux-agent

This project is a tmux plugin rewritten in Go. Its architecture, feature set,
tmux option names, activity log format, key bindings, and the shell/JSON/JS
assets in assets/ derive from:

  hiroppy/tmux-agent-sidebar
  https://github.com/hiroppy/tmux-agent-sidebar
  Copyright (c) hiroppy — MIT License

Files in assets/ are copied as-is (except for the binary path) and keep the
original project's MIT license.
